     LINEAR EQUATION SOLVER TYPE         DIRECT SPARSE
  
                   M E M O R Y   E S T I M A T E
  
 PROCESS      FLOATING PT       MINIMUM MEMORY        MEMORY TO
              OPERATIONS           REQUIRED          MINIMIZE I/O
